    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with Kantian limits of cognition and cognitive biases. While Kantian limits of cognition and cognitive biases often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Avidya expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
