    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with existential autonomy and transcendental freedom. While existential autonomy and transcendental freedom often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Kaivalya expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
