    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with substance ontology and process philosophy. While substance ontology and process philosophy often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Dravya expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
