    related_texts: ['A Theory of Justice', 'Meditations'],
    related_concepts: ['Veil of Ignorance', 'Reason'],
    sit_with_this: "If the reality of your self and the world is fundamentally characterized by Veil of Ignorance, how does that shift the weight of the moral choices you make today?"
