    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with sociology of knowledge and organizational change. While sociology of knowledge and organizational change often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Paradigm Shift expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
