    related_texts: ['The Phenomenology of Spirit', 'Meditations'],
    related_concepts: ['Hegelian Spirit', 'Reason'],
    sit_with_this: "If the reality of your self and the world is fundamentally characterized by Hegelian Spirit, how does that shift the weight of the moral choices you make today?"
