    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with mystical absorption and ego dissolution. While mystical absorption and ego dissolution often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Sitting in Forgetfulness expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
