    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with process theology and philosophy of science. While process theology and philosophy of science often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Reconstruction of Thought expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
