    in_dialogue_with: "This concept enters into an active, fruitful dialogue with rationalism and intellectual reform. While rationalism and intellectual reform often seeks to analyze truth through a specific, structured lens, Ijtihad Reason expands this view by highlighting the relational, intuitive, or contextual dimensions of understanding. This comparison reveals that different traditions often converge on the same fundamental problems of existence, using different vocabularies to express a shared human search for meaning.",
